cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the software component and the accompanying article."
type: software
title: "ataa-stress-surrogate: a deep-learning surrogate of ATAA wall mechanics"
abstract: >-
  A geometry-grouped deep-learning surrogate that maps a compact description of ascending
  thoracic aortic aneurysm geometry, material properties, and pressure to nodal stress and
  deformation-tensor fields. Includes the model definition, scalers, a patient-free synthetic
  example, and the training and evaluation pipeline; trained weights are intentionally excluded.
